h cosmic powers;\nthey've done what they could but Spydrë is [b]ours.[/b] ","source_tag":"_t","target":"每个清晨醒来都很愉快\n坟墓里的陷阱今天仍能躲开\n尽管饥饿诅咒让我痛苦难耐\n我的诅咒更加强力，持久不改\n\n诅咒哥布林的厄运\n诅咒窃取世界的神祇\n诅咒吸取魔力的冰寒\n诅咒群星旋转变暗\n\n纵使命运不公\n如今仅我存活\n尽情诅咒亡者\n我等兴盛蓬勃\n\n智慧力量协作\n三者胜过万物\n他人尽其所能\n蜘蛛已然[b]归我。[/b] "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b24aa3ce9f440a825dd3e386ac81a458f74ab97b4a8bd6c4bdc9db6503b2187","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31ac77284e55142dbaf6ff83c2ccd1af3f88ebf192406836263e4960fb25f10","logical_entry_identity":"2178a33d4be4827aaa3bd47262d0a7bfe99c426d7e549a8d5e7305c0c0717b95","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of madness","source_tag":"entity name","target":"疯狂之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b967646167913d12d85c2eef19a784c857676562ee84bde18243c9918ba23e9f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31b775fdb1e14535695af0bdc283824605e10089da0da89a8b15fcaa0557931","logical_entry_identity":"e59bfa037864dbd54f51c14ee5be3335eb38d216847c997c32e05990273f2a60","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pure Aether","source_tag":"talent name","target":"以太掌握"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6f139ffe7855f04e1c06825fa72cad8ace2b51045d559032b27204a37902f6e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c31e1b38891fb58a416ff8f19d73ba73efaaa39c4c417fc30133e2cebead85ea","logical_entry_identity":"954e9b48964115e876a2fed246098093d549b0782d779c66421ee2d49b8f7688","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Anomaly immunity chance#LAST#\nThis represents your chance to avoid most chronomatic anomaly effects.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#异常免疫几率#LAST#\n这代表你免疫大部分时空异常效果的几率。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e06762f78404d6987893253bc06db55329e05ada931281ea694647dfd06c996","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c321f17aeb7eb3ed620634e6772c68ea841da60d6b24ab04c524788cd34c66b9","logical_entry_identity":"348586387c5e877d8e2418ad795f649f893518f27d87fadd2f7e7702d87e7b4a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#F53CBE#%s ignores the panic!",